<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="2">

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALEC"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. News Desk Over Black</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>TITLES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec sits and rants. Audio fades in slowly under titles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But you can’t even trust your news!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>People prefer information that is meticulously tailored to their specific demographics.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The by product of this is you are constantly reassured that you are correct.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Video begins fading in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That your way of thinking is right.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And that’s where we stop digging.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Fade in finishes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">ONSCREEN:</Text>
      <Text> One Month Ago</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Because being right feels good.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And we don’t want to ween ourselves from that teat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Look.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>There exists multiple truths and realities, depending on your chosen news source.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The more you insulate yourself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Close yourself off from competing ideas.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The more you feel correct.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The more willing you are to go to extremes to prove it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. NoHo Rag StudioS - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">ONSCREEN:</Text>
      <Text> Today</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec walks somberly away from the studios.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. NOHo At Large - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>A couple of shots of Alec walking, maybe a few sight gags. No audio, some song is full volume.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CAITLIN"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHLOE"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Coffee Shop</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Two ladies sit, talking. The women are dressed way down, almost in sweats and workout/sleepwear. Unkempt. They either look like they just woke up or just worked out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Chloe</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I just can’t believe The NoHo Rag would stoop so low for ratings.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I thought Alec was above that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Caitlin nods and sips her coffee.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Caitlin</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Seriously.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Are we sexualizing our news now?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Jesus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Chloe leans in as Alec walks by.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>CHLOE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That show was literally my safe space.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Chloe leans back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Chloe (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That night, I did not feel safe at all...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALEC"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MATT"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. Park</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec walks past a man wearing a baseball cap, the man stops him. That man is Matt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Matt</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Hey buddy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Now I gotta explain nipples to my kid!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Ever since your “newscast” he’s been asking all these questions!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Like “Does mommy have nipples?”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>How am I supposed to answer that?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Say “yes” and be happy you are raising an inquisitive child.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Matt drops his head then looks at his watch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MATT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>There are just some questions that shouldn’t be asked.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That’s all I’m saying.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Matt walks off. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Matt (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’m glad you got fired.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You don’t deserve to decide what’s news.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec watches him leave and is clearly processing the interaction that just finished.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Hmmm</Text>
      <Text>....</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Ok</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec turns and walks away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALEC"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TOM"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. NoHo Border</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec is tired. Walks almost without purpose past an old crotchety Christian, leaning on a shovel. He is Tom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Tom</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Well, look who’s here!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Mister Reidel!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec makes a “this is bullshit” pouty face as he stops and willing takes his berating. Alec doesn’t make eye contact, he is clearly being talked at.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec sighs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>...What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Tom</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Enjoying early retirement?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Big Tom laugh.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Tom leans closer and closer to Alec’s ear:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Tom (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Puritanical values put you out of business.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The war is over, boy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We won.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec swats Tom’s face away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>TOM (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Ooh</Text>
      <Text>! Still got a little fight left in you!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Tom gets serious.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>TOM (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’ll lose that, too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Another burst of energy:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>TOM (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Now go on!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Get!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec begins walking away. Tom shouts from a distance:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>TOM (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>NoHo don’t need you no mo’!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We got it from here!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It’s in the good book!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Read it sometime, you Heretic!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec looks up, sees the Welcome to Burbank sign and sighs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>He walks over the line.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Smash to black on a swell of kick ass orchestration.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Epic. Fucking. Shit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

